<section class="content-window">
  <div class="window-titlebar"><h1>Client Reference Map</h1><span>two-source reference</span></div>
  <div class="summary-grid"><div class="summary-card"><strong>{{formatNumber stats.total_entries}}</strong><span>общо записи</span></div><div class="summary-card"><strong>{{formatBytes stats.zip_size_bytes}}</strong><span>ZIP размер</span></div><div class="summary-card"><strong>{{formatBytes stats.total_uncompressed_bytes}}</strong><span>разархивиран размер</span></div><div class="summary-card"><strong>{{formatNumber stats.log_files}}</strong><span>лог файла</span></div></div>
  <div class="reference-note"><strong>Правило:</strong> Client ZIP-ът и ZipMasterR23 ZIP-ът се използват само като reference карта. Не се копират и не се изпълняват `.exe`, `.bpl`, `.dll` файлове. Private log extract-ите са отделени в `docs/reference/private/`.</div>
</section>
<section class="content-window"><div class="window-titlebar"><h2>ERP модули от reference клиента</h2><span>{{formatNumber modules.length}} модула</span></div><table class="erp-table"><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>AutoGrand модул</th><th>Папка</th><th>Приоритет</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each modules}}<tr><td><code>{{package}}</code></td><td><a href="/modules/{{id}}">{{title_bg}}</a></td><td><code>{{target_path}}</code></td><td>{{priority}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></section>
<section class="content-window"><div class="window-titlebar"><h2>Log summary</h2><span>{{logs.date_min}} → {{logs.date_max}}</span></div><div class="log-grid"><div><strong>{{formatNumber logs.matched_diagnostic_lines}}</strong><span>matched diagnostic lines</span></div><div><strong>{{formatNumber logs.log_files}}</strong><span>log files</span></div></div><p class="muted">Подробният JSON е в <code>docs/reference/generated/log_error_summary.json</code>.</p></section>
